Hireling contract and wage simulation.
Day 1 begins with 22 gold.
Day 1
Treasury pays 5 to Ari.
Ari remains motivated at morale 9.
Treasury pays 7 to Bora.
Bora remains motivated at morale 7.
Treasury after payroll: 10
Ari: employed, morale 9, contract_days 1.
Bora: employed, morale 7, contract_days 2.
Day 2
Treasury pays 5 to Ari.
Ari remains motivated at morale 10.
Ari accepts contract renewal and serves 2 more days.
Bora waits unpaid today.
Bora morale drops to 5.
Treasury after payroll: 0
Ari: employed, morale 9, contract_days 2.
Bora: employed, morale 5, contract_days 1.
Day 3
Ari waits unpaid today.
Ari morale drops to 7.
Bora waits unpaid today.
Bora morale drops to 3.
Bora declines renewal due low morale.
Treasury after payroll: 0
Ari: employed, morale 7, contract_days 1.
Bora: contract ended.
Day 4
Ari waits unpaid today.
Ari morale drops to 5.
Ari declines renewal due low morale.
Bora is not employed.
Treasury after payroll: 0
Ari: contract ended.
Bora: contract ended.
Day 4 cycle complete.
Final tally.
Treasury: 0
Ari: contract ended.
Bora: contract ended.
